    <detaileddescription>
<para>This folder holds the definitions of the inline functions and of the templates declared in the headers of the parent folder, in files named after them, with the <computeroutput>-inlines</computeroutput> suffix: the check results, counters, deprecated definitions, shared templates, exception checks, expression formatter, function comparators, mathematical helpers, reflection, reporters, runner and its options, stopwatch, test suites and test cases, and string utilities.</para>
<para>The contents of this folder are intended solely for internal use within the library and should not be included directly by user code.  </para>
